{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/guidance/help-with-employment-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return","content_id":"cb31c87d-0a62-4447-b3a8-d9d48abb9af8","description":"Find information on completing the employment section of your Self Assessment tax return.","details":{"attachments":[],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>As an employee, you may:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>have to <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/tax-company-benefits\">pay tax on company benefits</a>\n</li>\n  <li>be able to <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/tax-relief-for-employees\">claim tax relief for job expenses</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 id=\"helpsheets-for-filling-in-your-tax-return\">Helpsheets for filling in your tax return</h2>\n\n<p>Helpsheets provide information that can help you complete different sections of your Self Assessment tax return.</p>\n\n<p>The following helpsheets can help you complete the employment section of your tax return. For example, telling HMRC about the expenses paid by your employer and working out the figures you might need to include in your return.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"expenses-and-benefits-paid-by-your-employer\">Expenses and benefits paid by your employer</h3>\n\n<p>Read helpsheets about:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>paying tax on your <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/living-accommodation-hs202-self-assessment-helpsheet\">living accommodation (HS202)</a>\n</li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/non-taxable-payments-or-benefits-for-employees-hs207-self-assessment-helpsheet\">non-taxable payments or benefits for employees (HS207)</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/payments-in-kind-assets-transferred-hs213-self-assessment-helpsheet\">payments in kind and asset transfers (HS213)</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"claiming-for-capital-allowances\">Claiming for capital allowances</h3>\n\n<p>Find more information on <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/capital-allowances-and-balancing-charges-hs252-self-assessment-helpsheet\">capital allowances and balancing charges (HS252)</a> such as:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>plant and machinery allowances</li>\n  <li>disposing of equipment</li>\n  <li>cars</li>\n  <li>accounting periods that are different from the tax year</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"seafarers-earnings-deduction\">Seafarers’ Earnings Deduction</h3>\n\n<p>Find out if you qualify for the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/seafarers-earnings-deduction-hs205-self-assessment-helpsheet\">Seafarers’ Earnings Deduction (HS205)</a> (it covers work on ships, but not other offshore installations).</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"if-youre-not-a-uk-resident\">If you’re not a UK resident</h3>\n\n<p>Use <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/employment-residence-and-domicile-issues-hs211-self-assessment-helpsheet\">Employment, residence and domicile issues (HS211)</a> to calculate the amounts you got from each employment that are not liable for UK Income Tax.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"tax-equalisation\">Tax equalisation</h3>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/tax-equalisation-hs212-self-assessment-helpsheet\">Tax equalisation (HS212)</a> is intended to assist professional advisers and employers who are preparing tax returns for tax equalised individuals. It provides:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>a brief description of tax equalisation</li>\n  <li>amended instructions to help complete the Employment section of your tax return</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 id=\"hmrc-youtube-video\">HMRC YouTube video</h2>\n\n<p>Watch a recorded webinar about filling in the employment section of your tax return.</p>\n\n<p><a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSo2gG2TAjQ\">The employment section of your online tax return</a>.</p>\n\n<p>You will learn about:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>record keeping</li>\n  <li>how to fill in your return</li>\n  <li>tax relief for employment expenses</li>\n  <li>student loan and postgraduate loan repayments</li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"The webinar about filling in the employment section of your tax return has been updated with the latest version. ","public_timestamp":"2025-09-10T14:56:42Z"},{"note":"Added translation","public_timestamp":"2025-04-29T23:00:00Z"}],"emphasised_organisations":["6667cce2-e809-4e21-ae09-cb0bdc1ddda3"],"first_public_at":"2025-04-30T00:00:00.000+01:00","headers":[{"headers":[{"id":"expenses-and-benefits-paid-by-your-employer","level":3,"text":"Expenses and benefits paid by your employer"},{"id":"claiming-for-capital-allowances","level":3,"text":"Claiming for capital allowances"},{"id":"seafarers-earnings-deduction","level":3,"text":"Seafarers' Earnings Deduction"},{"id":"if-youre-not-a-uk-resident","level":3,"text":"If you're not a UK resident"},{"id":"tax-equalisation","level":3,"text":"Tax equalisation"}],"id":"helpsheets-for-filling-in-your-tax-return","level":2,"text":"Helpsheets for filling in your tax return"},{"id":"hmrc-youtube-video","level":2,"text":"HMRC YouTube video"}],"political":false,"related_mainstream_content":[],"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"detailed_guide","first_published_at":"2025-04-30T00:00:00+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/guidance/help-with-employment-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return.cy","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/guidance/help-with-employment-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return.cy","base_path":"/guidance/help-with-employment-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return.cy","content_id":"cb31c87d-0a62-4447-b3a8-d9d48abb9af8","document_type":"detailed_guide","links":{},"locale":"cy","public_updated_at":"2025-09-10T14:56:42Z","schema_name":"detailed_guide","title":"Help gyda chyflogaeth ar eich Ffurflen Dreth Hunanasesiad","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/help-with-employment-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return.cy","withdrawn":false},{"api_path":"/api/content/guidance/help-with-employment-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/guidance/help-with